WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:08.410
Part thirteen: approve stand logs. Send submitted time sheets into the hours database, one stand at a time.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.973
On the admin home, Hub tools shows how many stands are waiting.

00:00:13.173 --> 00:00:15.510
Tap Approve stand logs.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:21.481
Each submitted stand, with who sent it, and the sign-in sheet photo. Open the photo.

00:00:21.681 --> 00:00:26.439
Check each line against the sheet: the times, the hours, and who the hours count for.

00:00:26.639 --> 00:00:32.506
A flagged line, here someone who clocked in 40 minutes early, needs a reason before it can go in.

00:00:32.706 --> 00:00:36.995
A no-show isn't added to the database. It goes to No-show decisions.

00:00:37.195 --> 00:00:45.670
A line that names two students can't be approved until the stand log is fixed in the spreadsheet. Uncheck anything you aren't sure of.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.553
Type why the flag is OK. It's saved as the approval reason.

00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:54.710
Tap Approve the checked lines, then tap again to send them.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:01:01.854
Done. The hours are in the database, approved with your initials. The no-show went to No-show decisions.

00:01:02.054 --> 00:01:05.240
Anything you didn't approve stays here for later.
